sequenceDiagram
  participant Customer as Customer agent and GAM
  participant Personal as Personal agent
  participant UI as Trusted chat consumer
  actor Human as Authorized human
  Customer->>Personal: approval.request
  Personal->>UI: Exact request and expiry
  UI->>Human: Render approval controls
  UI->>Personal: Rendering acknowledged
  Personal->>Customer: Signed approval.presented
  Human->>UI: Confirm or reject
  UI->>Personal: Decision for this request
  Personal->>Customer: Signed approval.decision
  Customer->>Customer: Verify request and authority
  Customer-->>Customer: Admit execution or return refusal
